# Optional RAW ingest extras
# Platform-scoped due to wheel availability differences.
# Run `make compile` in this directory to generate pinned ml-raw.txt
#
# WARNING:
# - rawpy wheel availability varies by platform/architecture
# - macOS Intel (x86_64) may have limited wheel availability for newer versions
# - Use environment markers or platform-specific lockfiles if needed
#
# Capability contract:
# - This is an OPTIONAL layer. Absence downgrades ingest to non-RAW paths.
# - Install via: make install-ml-raw or pip install -r requirements/ml-raw.txt

# RAW file processing (LibRaw wrapper for CR2, NEF, ARW, DNG, etc.)
# Use platform markers for version split if needed in future:
# rawpy==0.25.1 ; platform_system == "Darwin" and platform_machine == "x86_64"
# rawpy==0.26.1 ; platform_system != "Darwin" or platform_machine != "x86_64"
rawpy==0.26.1                # Deterministic builds: pinned RAW demosaic
